          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You have developed a soul-deep bond with your comrades and maintain an even greater degree of cooperation with them. If you are at least an expert in the skill you are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Aid]{Aiding}, when you roll a failure or critical failure to Aid a skill check, you get a success instead.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 9
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
